      "kind": "text",
      "default": "确认",
      "maxChars": 3,
      "font": "head"
    },
    "again": {
      "kind": "text",
      "default": "再招募十次",
      "maxChars": 5,
      "font": "head"
    },
    "again_note": {
      "kind": "text",
      "default": "日光券不足（剩余 2）",
      "maxChars": 12,
      "font": "label"
    }
  },
  "relations": [
    "The top pull (card 0) is twice the other cards and the only lemon plate when it is 6 stars; it overlaps nothing.",
    "Rarity is the plate, not a glow: 6 lemon, 5 paper, 4 deep teal with paper text, 3 sand.",
    "Cards tilt -5 to +5 degrees, each with the same hard shadow; the summary card sits at the right edge."
  ],
  "decoration": [
    "Dashed star frames, sun on the top pull, icons, pool tiles: drawn."
  ],
  "provenance": {
    "corpus": "gacha-event case v3 (白昼公馆「三点钟的泳池」): our own original fictional gacha event in the citypop-sleeve grammar",
    "experiment": "styles/citypop-sleeve/style.json provenance; case renders in docs/cases/gacha-event",
    "accessed": "2026-11-05",
    "method": "Card positions and tilts taken from the case's final ten-pull screen (ui-result.cjs) in 1920-unit coordinates; names are the case's original roster.",
    "sampleIds": [
      "gacha-event/04-ten-pull"
    ],
    "measured": [
      "First pass: 12 contrast findings (4-star cards on deep pool #1AA3AD: deep-teal text 4.03:1) and 1 by eye (white lifebuoy on the white sun); final 0 after 4-star plates became deep teal with paper text."
    ],
    "summary": "gacha-event v3 ten-pull"
  }
}
